WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.300
-As COVID cases are,
once again, surging

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.667
and a new variant is spreading,

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.234
Republicans are claiming,
falsely,

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:08.434
that Democrats want
to return to lockdowns

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:11.367
and suggesting that you can use
mouthwash to treat COVID.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.367
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:18.100
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.167
With holiday travel, COVID cases
are, once again, on the rise

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:24.133
and, now, there's a new variant
that, early indications suggest,

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.400
is even more transmissible
than Delta,

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.834
called the Omicron variant.

00:00:27.834 --> 00:00:29.567
We got one of our
earliest introductions

00:00:29.567 --> 00:00:30.834
to how the virus spreads

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:33.267
from a large gathering
in New York City recently.

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.968
-The CDC has now contacted

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:37.400
more than 35,000 people

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.234
who attended a recent animé
convention in New York City

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:43.367
to alert them
of a COVID case there.

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.701
Scientists believe
the convention could give them

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:49.534
the earliest looks at the spread
of Omicron in the U.S.

00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:52.000
-Hey, COVID, you leave
our animé conventions alone!

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.767
[ Laughter ]
If animé fans

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.701
can't talk to each other
in a convention setting,

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:56.968
they're going to bring it
to the office,

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:58.200
and nobody wants that!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.534
"Hey, just FYI,

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:02.100
there was a new 'Sailor Moon'
last night,

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.100
so, maybe steer clear of Dave."

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.267 --> 00:01:07.434
And it's an extra bummer,
since Omicron

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:10.267
sounds exactly like a character
name from animé.

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.767
[ Laughter ]
That must've been weird

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.000
for the contact tracers.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.133
I'm calling to let you know

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.434
you may have come in contact

00:01:15.434 --> 00:01:17.167
with Omicron
at the animé convention.

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.334
"Aw, no way!
I should've got an autograph!"

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:20.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.234
And, by the way,
I'm saying all of this

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:24.067
as a self-identified
comic book fan.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:25.234
I am not judging.

00:01:25.234 --> 00:01:27.934
It is hard to find people
with the same interests.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:30.367
I mean, when I worked at "SNL,"
I used to go to Lorne's office

00:01:30.367 --> 00:01:32.534
and ask him who his favorite
"Spider-Man" character was

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:35.200
and he'd say Norman Osborn.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.567
[ As Michaels ]
You know, everyone focuses

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:38.701
on the Green Goblin,
but they forgot

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:40.167
Oscorp did some
really good things.

00:01:40.167 --> 00:01:43.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.167
And, by the way, if COVID can
spread at an animé convention,

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.734
can you imagine how bad it'll be
at other mass gatherings?

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:50.033
Have you ever been to SantaCon?

00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:51.467
That thing was
a superspreader event

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:53.767
[ Laughter ]
before COVID even existed.

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.367
If you have children,
I beg of you,

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:57.400
keep them away from midtown
during SantaCon.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.000
It will scar them
for the rest of their lives.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.267
[ Laughter ]
And I know from experience.

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:01.567
I'll never forget
my kids saying,

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:04.567
"Daddy, why is Santa peeing
on a police car?"

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:05.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:07.067
Uh, well, uh...

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:09.634
that cop was very bad this year
and Santa's out of coal.

00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.868 --> 00:02:13.534
So they detected Omicron
at an animé convention,

00:02:13.534 --> 00:02:15.434
which then allowed it
to spread to other states.

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.300
Yesterday,
CNN interviewed someone

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.701
with one of the earliest cases,
who, thankfully,

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:22.334
had only very mild symptoms
and quickly recovered,

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:24.534
which he credited to the fact
that he was vaccinated,

00:02:24.534 --> 00:02:27.133
although the anchors
still seemed a little suspicious

00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:28.400
when he started sniffling.

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.801
-So tell us
about your experience

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.534
of getting sick with Omicron.

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:34.934
What were your symptoms?
What was it like?

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:38.234
-Yeah, I had a very light
what I thought was a cold --

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:40.367
fatigue, cough, runny nose --

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:43.167
which only lasted
about 24 hours.

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:45.000
I'm very pro-vaccine
and I think,

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:47.634
because of me getting
the booster and my vaccine,

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.200
that I was able to recover
so fast

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.767
and my symptoms were so mild.

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:53.400
[ Sniffle ]

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.033
-Peter, are you okay now?

00:02:56.033 --> 00:02:58.033
It sounds like you got
the sniffles, a little nasally.

00:02:58.033 --> 00:02:59.200
What's going on?
How you feeling?

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.467
-No. Unfortunately,
living in Minnesota,

00:03:01.467 --> 00:03:04.033
it's freezing cold
all the time, so,

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:06.667
just the air gets to me
and I also have asthma,

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:09.100
so it's just like it's
an ongoing thing my entire life.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.334
[ Laughter ]
But I feel 100%.

00:03:11.334 --> 00:03:12.667
-Alright.
I was just checking.

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:13.901
[ Laughter ]
I heard a little sniffle

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:15.467
and a little nasally.

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:17.467
Just making sure you're alright.

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:19.734
-Unfortunately, this is just
how I sound all the time.

00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:21.334
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, now I feel bad.

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:24.167
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:24.167 --> 00:03:25.801
-Hey, man, I know what you're
going through.

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:29.067
I have asthma and I carry
an inhaler with me all the time.

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:32.400
I keep it at the desk in case
Sal writes some long, wordy run

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.100
where there's no time
for me to take a breath.

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:36.734
Plus, I need it after I do
my Mike Lindell impression

00:03:36.734 --> 00:03:38.868
because I don't know how
that guy does it, but I've --

00:03:38.868 --> 00:03:41.067
[ As Lindell ]
Never seen him take a breath!

00:03:41.067 --> 00:03:42.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:44.601
So I stand in solidarity
with you, Peter.

00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:47.534
But it's a sign of just
how paranoid we've all gotten,

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:49.000
that we hear a few sniffles

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.467
and we all turn
into virologists.

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:52.167
I mean, hearing a cough
on the subway now

00:03:52.167 --> 00:03:54.267
is like hearing a twig snap
in a horror movie.

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:56.501
[ Laughter ]
And, if I show any symptoms

00:03:56.501 --> 00:03:58.601
of a cold at home,
I have to make up a story,

00:03:58.601 --> 00:04:00.601
so my wife doesn't make me stay
at a hotel.

00:04:00.601 --> 00:04:02.133
"Um, why are you sniffling?"

00:04:02.133 --> 00:04:03.934
Um, I was, uh,

00:04:03.934 --> 00:04:06.501
doing some cocaine
with NYU students?

00:04:06.501 --> 00:04:08.834
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:08.834 --> 00:04:10.767
"You better be telling
the truth."

00:04:10.767 --> 00:04:12.734
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.734 --> 00:04:16.033
The point is, pandemic life
sucks, we all hate it,

00:04:16.033 --> 00:04:18.100
but as much as we may be done
with COVID,

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.300
COVID is not done with us.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.400
That's just the reality.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.300
Thankfully,
we have so many more tools

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.634
at our disposal now
to deal with it,

00:04:23.634 --> 00:04:26.801
like vaccines, boosters,
high-quality masks,

00:04:26.801 --> 00:04:28.601
ventilation, and rapid tests,

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.300
which everyone
should have access to.

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.367
Trying to get your hands
on a rapid test right now

00:04:33.367 --> 00:04:35.534
is like trying to buy
a Tamagotchi in the '90s.

00:04:35.534 --> 00:04:37.767
[ Laughter ]
And if you don't get
that reference,

00:04:37.767 --> 00:04:39.367
the '90s were a decade
that happened

00:04:39.367 --> 00:04:40.801
10 years before you were born.

00:04:40.801 --> 00:04:43.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.300
Before Tom Holland,
there was Tam Agotchi.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.801
[ Boisterous laughter
and applause ]

00:04:49.801 --> 00:04:51.400
That's my Tom Holland!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.601 --> 00:04:55.133
The new one
won't let me feed 'im!

00:04:55.133 --> 00:04:59.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.834 --> 00:05:01.267
In other developed nations,

00:05:01.267 --> 00:05:04.234
rapid tests are all either
super cheap and widely available

00:05:04.234 --> 00:05:05.868
or provided for free
by the government,

00:05:05.868 --> 00:05:07.100
which is how it should be here.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.667
Instead, the Biden
administration has, somehow,

00:05:08.667 --> 00:05:11.234
come up with the worst
of all possible options --

00:05:11.234 --> 00:05:12.567
by the test yourself,

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:15.033
then get reimbursed
by your insurance provider.

00:05:15.033 --> 00:05:16.534
-Now, two years
into this pandemic

00:05:16.534 --> 00:05:18.234
and the thing we needed
in month one

00:05:18.234 --> 00:05:19.767
is still the thing
that we need today --

00:05:19.767 --> 00:05:22.567
widespread, easy, rapid testing.

00:05:22.567 --> 00:05:24.434
Last week, President Joe Biden
announced his plan

00:05:24.434 --> 00:05:27.534
to have private insurers
cover the cost of at-home tests,

00:05:27.534 --> 00:05:29.534
meaning you can buy a test,
submit the cost,

00:05:29.534 --> 00:05:31.667
and your insurance
will reimburse you for it.

00:05:31.667 --> 00:05:32.968
-Have you ever tried
to get reimbursed

00:05:32.968 --> 00:05:34.367
by an insurance provider?
There are like

00:05:34.367 --> 00:05:36.634
80 pages of forms to fill out
and, inevitably,

00:05:36.634 --> 00:05:38.834
you get a letter
six months later that says...

00:05:43.367 --> 00:05:45.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.367
[ Laughter ]

00:05:57.634 --> 00:05:59.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.934 --> 00:06:07.701
A situation like this is when
it really becomes clear

00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:10.267
just how screwed up our
for-profit medical system is.

00:06:10.267 --> 00:06:11.534
This week, a reporter suggested

00:06:11.534 --> 00:06:13.200
the insurance
reimbursement system

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.434
might be too complicated,

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:16.567
and asked why we can't
just provide free tests,

00:06:16.567 --> 00:06:18.000
like other countries, and then,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.901
White House Press Secretary
Jen Psaki

00:06:19.901 --> 00:06:22.367
mocked the question
by jokingly asking

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:25.534
if the White House should just
send free tests out in the mail.

00:06:25.534 --> 00:06:26.767
-There are still
a lot of countries,

00:06:26.767 --> 00:06:28.767
like Germany
and the UK and South Korea,

00:06:28.767 --> 00:06:30.767
that basically have
massive testing,

00:06:30.767 --> 00:06:33.434
free of charge
or for a nominal fee.

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:35.767
Why can't that be done
in the United States?

00:06:35.767 --> 00:06:37.567
-Well, I would say, first,
you know,

00:06:37.567 --> 00:06:41.400
we have eight tests that have
been approved by the FDA here

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.167
and this effort to push

00:06:44.167 --> 00:06:47.067
to ensure insurers --
you're are able to get your --

00:06:47.067 --> 00:06:50.000
your tests refunded means
150 million Americans

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.133
will be able to get free tests.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.734
Why not just make them free
and give them out

00:06:54.734 --> 00:06:56.000
and have them
available everywhere?

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.000
-Should we just send one
to every American?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:06:59.400
-Yes!
[ Laughter ]

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.167
You should send a test
to every Amer--

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:03.467
I mean, if Pottery Barn
can send every American

00:07:03.467 --> 00:07:05.100
[ Laughter ]
eight catalogs a year,

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.400
you should be able
to pull off one.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.167
You know what? Maybe we should
just outsource this

00:07:08.167 --> 00:07:11.000
to Pottery Barn and let them
put ads on the swabs.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:12.434 --> 00:07:14.267
Seriously,
why is that ridiculous?

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:16.033
Other countries
with public health systems

00:07:16.033 --> 00:07:16.734
are already doing it...

00:07:21.834 --> 00:07:24.000
Of course, over there,
they're not called rapid tests.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.501
They're called...

00:07:25.501 --> 00:07:26.767
[ Laughter ]
I know!

00:07:26.767 --> 00:07:29.734
I also think that's dumb!

00:07:29.734 --> 00:07:32.734
We desperately need easy access
to free, rapid testing

00:07:32.734 --> 00:07:33.934
for anyone who wants it,

00:07:33.934 --> 00:07:36.734
on top of our vaccines,
boosters, and masks.

00:07:36.734 --> 00:07:40.267
We have so many more tools now
than we did back in March 2020,

00:07:40.267 --> 00:07:42.200
which is why
we don't need lockdowns.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:43.934
Biden has already
ruled out lockdowns, for now,

00:07:43.934 --> 00:07:46.734
and I think it's safe to say
no one wants to go back to that,

00:07:46.734 --> 00:07:47.801
Democrat or Republican.

00:07:47.801 --> 00:07:49.501
I don't want to go back
to my attic

00:07:49.501 --> 00:07:52.267
[ Laughter ]
and I certainly don't want to go
back to my in-laws' house.

00:07:52.267 --> 00:07:54.601
[ Laughter ]
Okay, now, real quick,

00:07:54.601 --> 00:07:57.434
I need to film an alternate
version of that for my in-laws,

00:07:57.434 --> 00:07:59.000
and then we'll edit it in
and then, this will be

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.601
the "Closer Look" we show them.
Alright, ready?

00:08:01.601 --> 00:08:03.300
I don't want to go back
to my attic,

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.901
but I wouldn't mind going back
to my in-laws' house,

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:06.100
because I love it there.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:07.734
[ Laughter and applause ]
Everyone's super chill

00:08:07.734 --> 00:08:10.200
and they always sing karaoke
with perfect pitch.

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.601
[ Laughter ]

00:08:12.601 --> 00:08:15.434
Okay, back to the real
"Closer Look."

00:08:15.434 --> 00:08:17.868
I don't want to go back
to my [bleep] in-laws' house!

00:08:17.868 --> 00:08:19.467
[ Laughter and applause ]
Thankfully, Biden has

00:08:19.467 --> 00:08:21.167
ruled that out, for now,

00:08:21.167 --> 00:08:22.767
although, you wouldn't know it
from Fox News,

00:08:22.767 --> 00:08:25.033
which has been lying for days
about Democrats threatening

00:08:25.033 --> 00:08:27.067
to shut everything down again
over Omicron.

00:08:27.067 --> 00:08:29.534
-Democrats are already
using this to jam through

00:08:29.534 --> 00:08:32.334
their pro-lockdown,
anti-freedom agenda.

00:08:32.334 --> 00:08:35.400
-They want us to go
on shutdown, lockdown, again.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.567
-Then they want
to implement

00:08:36.567 --> 00:08:38.067
more ridiculous lockdowns.

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:39.934
-They want us
to lock down our lives,

00:08:39.934 --> 00:08:41.467
with no information,

00:08:41.467 --> 00:08:44.000
lock down our kids' lives,
with no information.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.901
-The Biden administration is,
once again,

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:47.534
locking down the country

00:08:47.534 --> 00:08:50.167
and persecuting its perceived
political opponents,

00:08:50.167 --> 00:08:53.267
otherwise known
as the unvaccinated.

00:08:53.267 --> 00:08:55.667
So you have to ask yourself,
"When will this end?"

00:08:55.667 --> 00:08:57.434
Viruses mutate constantly.

00:08:57.434 --> 00:08:59.000
That's their nature.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.267
Will every new "Omeecron"
variant mean massive new

00:09:02.267 --> 00:09:05.067
[ Laughter ]
and unconstitutional powers
for our political class?

00:09:05.067 --> 00:09:06.400
-[ As Carlson ]
When will it end?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.000
[ Laughter ]
Will every new variant mean

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.634
new powers
for our political class?

00:09:09.634 --> 00:09:11.734
Will they be able to test you,
trace you,

00:09:11.734 --> 00:09:13.767
come to your house
and inject you with a microchip,

00:09:13.767 --> 00:09:15.534
hidden in a vaccine,
that tracks your movements?

00:09:15.534 --> 00:09:17.901
And what that tracking microchip
allow them to see

00:09:17.901 --> 00:09:20.667
that you went to the animé
convention in secret, of course,

00:09:20.667 --> 00:09:23.367
[ Laughter ]
because you didn't want
your friends at Fox News

00:09:23.367 --> 00:09:24.934
to know that you're
into that kind of thing.

00:09:24.934 --> 00:09:27.334
And will they find out about the
time you asked Sean Hannity

00:09:27.334 --> 00:09:29.033
what he thought
of "Dragon Ball Z"

00:09:29.033 --> 00:09:30.834
[ Laughter ]
and he looked at you
like you were crazy

00:09:30.834 --> 00:09:32.667
and that hurt
your feelings so much

00:09:32.667 --> 00:09:34.634
that you ran
into the bathroom to cry,

00:09:34.634 --> 00:09:37.434
only to realize that you had run
into the women's bathroom

00:09:37.434 --> 00:09:38.801
[ Laughter ]
and were so worried

00:09:38.801 --> 00:09:40.300
that someone would see you
run out,

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.067
that you, instead,
removed a ceiling panel

00:09:42.067 --> 00:09:43.534
[ Laughter ]
and climbed into a heating duct

00:09:43.534 --> 00:09:45.734
for the purposes of shimmying
back to your office,

00:09:45.734 --> 00:09:47.133
not knowing that the duct

00:09:47.133 --> 00:09:49.133
wouldn't be strong enough
to support your weight,

00:09:49.133 --> 00:09:50.868
[ Laughter ]
causing you to, mid-shimmy,

00:09:50.868 --> 00:09:53.267
collapse through the ceiling,
where you landed on top

00:09:53.267 --> 00:09:55.834
of Rupert Murdoch's desk
while he was sitting at it,

00:09:55.834 --> 00:09:58.267
causing him to look up from his
soup and yell, "Crikey!"?

00:09:58.267 --> 00:09:59.968
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.968 --> 00:10:01.100
Will that happen to you?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.334
Well, I can tell you it will.

00:10:03.334 --> 00:10:04.534
Because it happened to me.

00:10:04.534 --> 00:10:06.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.734
Also, I want to revisit that
Don Jr. clip from the montage

00:10:08.734 --> 00:10:09.901
because he had more to say,

00:10:09.901 --> 00:10:12.300
specifically,
about Dr. Anthony Fauci.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.567
-If you look at, you know,

00:10:13.567 --> 00:10:15.434
let's call it an elf

00:10:15.434 --> 00:10:19.400
with a Napoleonic complex,
bureaucrat Fauci,

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:20.801
he doesn't know
what he's talking about.

00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:21.734
He's a bureaucrat.

00:10:21.734 --> 00:10:22.767
He's not a good doctor.

00:10:22.767 --> 00:10:24.300
He's better
at being a bureaucrat.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:26.133
And, as long
as we keep giving that clown

00:10:26.133 --> 00:10:27.834
his 15 minutes of fame,

00:10:27.834 --> 00:10:30.567
the TV that he
so desperately craves,

00:10:30.567 --> 00:10:33.334
we're going to be in these
lockdown situations forever.

00:10:33.334 --> 00:10:34.667
-I'm sorry, he's an elf

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:36.167
[ Laughter ]
with a Napoleonic complex?

00:10:36.167 --> 00:10:37.934
You're so desperate
to look taller,

00:10:37.934 --> 00:10:39.367
you stand with your nipples
pointed out,

00:10:39.367 --> 00:10:41.067
like you're using them
as weapons.

00:10:41.067 --> 00:10:42.434
[ Laughter ]
[ As Don Jr. ]
Stay away from me, antifa!

00:10:42.434 --> 00:10:44.167
These bad boys will hurt you!

00:10:44.167 --> 00:10:45.968
[ Laughter ]
Also, I wouldn't call anyone
an elf,

00:10:45.968 --> 00:10:47.467
when you literally posed
for a photo

00:10:47.467 --> 00:10:49.501
on a stump in the woods,
like a troll who got kicked out

00:10:49.501 --> 00:10:50.701
of the Fellowship of the Rings.

00:10:50.701 --> 00:10:52.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
And, yes,

00:10:52.434 --> 00:10:54.434
I'm aware there were no trolls
in that fellowship.

00:10:54.434 --> 00:10:56.300
That's why they go sit
on stumps.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.901
So, Republicans are, as usual,

00:10:57.901 --> 00:10:59.434
lying about lockdowns
and vaccines.

00:10:59.434 --> 00:11:01.400
Instead, they'd rather focus
on absurd,

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.767
unproven remedies,
like hydroxychloroquine

00:11:03.767 --> 00:11:05.968
or ingesting bleach,
or this new one,

00:11:05.968 --> 00:11:08.701
from Wisconsin Senator
Ron Johnson -- mouthwash.

00:11:08.701 --> 00:11:09.934
-I want you to listen

00:11:09.934 --> 00:11:12.934
to Republican
Senator Ron Johnson

00:11:12.934 --> 00:11:15.267
at a town hall
just this week.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.434
-Or, even better,
don't use mouthwash,

00:11:28.434 --> 00:11:29.667
and your bad breath
will keep people

00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:31.234
six feet away from you
at all times.

00:11:31.234 --> 00:11:32.501
[ Laughter ]
Listerine

00:11:32.501 --> 00:11:34.868
explicitly states on its website
that its product...

00:11:40.667 --> 00:11:42.200
I don't even want
to imagine what's next.

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.000
Is Titleist going to have
to issue a statement

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:44.734
that says...

00:11:49.367 --> 00:11:51.367
[ Laughter ]

00:11:51.367 --> 00:11:53.000
We have proven tools
at our disposal

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.334
to protect people
from this virus,

00:11:54.334 --> 00:11:56.167
but right-wing politicians
and media figures

00:11:56.167 --> 00:11:58.234
are intent on fearmongering
and lying about it.

00:11:58.234 --> 00:12:00.067
Santa himself
could get vaccinated

00:12:00.067 --> 00:12:01.701
and they'd tell you he was
forced by a...

00:12:01.701 --> 00:12:05.200
-Elf with a Napoleonic complex.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.734
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:06.734 --> 00:12:10.534
♪♪

00:12:10.534 --> 00:12:12.033
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:12:12.033 --> 00:12:13.334
over two million meals a year

00:12:13.334 --> 00:12:15.534
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:15.534 --> 00:12:17.000
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.501
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:12:18.501 --> 00:12:20.734
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:12:20.734 --> 00:12:23.133
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

